{% if agent_providers.size > 1 -%}
Deterministic capabilities need only `uv`. Model-backed capabilities run through an agent
provider, the first installed of {{ agent_provider_series }}:

{% elsif agent_providers.size == 1 -%}
Deterministic capabilities need only `uv`. Model-backed capabilities run through the
{{ agent_provider_series }} agent provider:

